409..480 Comment "/// A pending completion handed to a reaping peer while its frame ends."
481..556 Comment "/// Refused today at the reaper: an endpoint received over a session is not"
557..627 Comment "/// acted on (#1167). With delegation, it waits on the buffer\'s region"
628..663 Comment "/// outliving the reaper\'s (#1164)."
